DESCRIPTION:Whether it be through a jacket\, or the words out his mouth\, C
 hase\nHarter is always making a statement. Chase was raised in Phoenix\nAri
 zona\, but thankfully was educated elsewhere growing up\, and has since\nho
 ned his craft through a slew of fast paced clever wordplay\, stacking\npunc
 hline after punchline. His comedy is heavily inspired and powered\nby his u
 ntreated ADHD and his tendency towards run-on sentences\; You\nnever know w
 hat he is going to say next\, and likely neither does he\, but\nyou can cou
 nt on it being erratic but hilarious. Chase touches on any\ntopic through h
 is lens as a gay man with raging ADHD traversing a red\nstate trying to bri
 ng everyone together. Don’t worry\, if the gay part\nscares you\, he’ll
  walk you to your car.\n\nYou may have already\nincidentally seen this man\
 , as he’s a regular opener for such legends as\nAmber Autry\, Fiona Caule
 y\, and Heather Shaw. Regardless\, Chase has a\nmade a name for himself thr
 ough showcasing through the multiple\nfestivals and competitions. Chase has
